1288
00:44:06,310 --> 00:44:08,312
Hello and welcome to
the Satellite of Love.

1289
00:44:08,312 --> 00:44:09,513
I'm Crow.

1290
00:44:09,513 --> 00:44:10,914
- And I'm Tom Servo
and we're hosts

1291
00:44:10,914 --> 00:44:13,250
