1292
00:44:13,250 --> 00:44:15,853
So let's meet our
guest, Brad Summers.

1293
00:44:15,853 --> 00:44:17,254
(cheering)

1294
00:44:17,254 --> 00:44:18,122
- Hey.

1295
00:44:18,122 --> 00:44:18,956
- Whoa.

1296
00:44:18,956 --> 00:44:20,491
- Oh, yipes.

1297
00:44:20,491 --> 00:44:21,925
