coming into our air space.

1298
00:44:21,925 --> 00:44:23,627
Cambot, give me rocket
number nine, quick.

1299
00:44:23,627 --> 00:44:26,530
Oh uh, looks like
we got company.

1300
00:44:28,866 --> 00:44:29,867
- Well, I'm gonna go get Joel.

1301
00:44:29,867 --> 00:44:30,768
- Good idea.

1302
00:44:30,768 --> 00:44:31,969
- Oh.

1303
00:44:31,969 --> 00:44:34,338
Look out, hold
me, Crow, hold me.

1304
00:44:34,338 --> 00:44:35,172
- What?

1305
00:44:35,172 --> 00:44:36,240
Hang on.

1306
00:44:36,240 --> 00:44:38,442
Gypsy, Gypsy girl,

1307
00:44:38,442 --> 00:44:40,210
whatever you do,
don't turn around.

1308
00:44:40,210 --> 00:44:41,812
Just don't turn around.

1309
00:44:41,812 --> 00:44:42,713
- Okay.

1310
00:44:42,713 --> 00:44:43,547
- No, no, no.

1311
00:44:43,547 --> 00:44:45,049
- Oh no.

1312
00:44:45,049 --> 00:44:46,450
Oh great, just great.

1313
00:44:46,450 --> 00:44:47,685
We lost Gypsy.

1314
00:44:47,685 --> 00:44:49,887
Where's Joel, he'd
know what to do.

1315
00:44:49,887 --> 00:44:53,724
Help me, you gregarious
galvanized garbage can.

1316
00:44:53,724 --> 00:44:55,359
Oh, the pain, the pain.

1317
00:44:55,359 --> 00:44:56,593
- Danger.

1318
00:44:56,593 --> 00:44:57,828
Danger Crow T. Robot, danger.

1319
00:44:57,828 --> 00:44:59,229
No, no, come on Crow,
you got me doing it now.

1320
00:44:59,229 --> 00:45:00,564
Get a grip, boy.

1321
00:45:00,564 --> 00:45:02,066
We have to remain rational.

1322
00:45:02,066 --> 00:45:04,401
This is just one of the
many sordid alien visitors

1323
00:45:04,401 --> 00:45:06,704
