minutes and then leaves.

1325
00:45:09,606 --> 00:45:10,607
It's no big deal.

1326
00:45:10,607 --> 00:45:11,608
(grunting)

1327
00:45:11,608 --> 00:45:12,743
Oh, oh.

1328
00:45:12,743 --> 00:45:14,311
I do believe in spooks,
I do believe in.

1329
00:45:14,311 --> 00:45:15,512
Oh mommy, mommy.

1330
00:45:15,512 --> 00:45:16,580
- Just stop it, Tom.

1331
00:45:16,580 --> 00:45:18,248
Come on, get ahold of yourself.

1332
00:45:18,248 --> 00:45:19,683
It's a common gorilla.

1333
00:45:19,683 --> 00:45:21,151
Probably one of those
horrible animal experiments

1334
00:45:21,151 --> 00:45:22,553
they used to shoot into space.

1335
00:45:22,553 --> 00:45:25,355
Just a big, old dumb gorilla.

1336
00:45:25,355 --> 00:45:27,491
The key with these creatures
is to talk nice to 'em.

1337
00:45:27,491 --> 00:45:29,293
Animals can sense fear

1338
00:45:29,293 --> 00:45:30,928
