1423
00:48:14,024 --> 00:48:14,858
- What, what?

1424
00:48:14,858 --> 00:48:16,159
Hey, hey cut it out.

1425
00:48:16,159 --> 00:48:17,828
You're making me cry.

1426
00:48:17,828 --> 00:48:18,762
- Well.

1427
00:48:18,762 --> 00:48:19,863
- Now, let's don't be formal.

1428
00:48:21,932 --> 00:48:22,933
- [Servo] Not you, too.

1429
00:48:22,933 --> 00:48:24,635
- Action stations.

1430
00:48:24,635 --> 00:48:26,303
Action stations everyone.

1431
00:48:26,303 --> 00:48:28,505
- [Joel] Action stations
figures sold separately.

1432
00:48:28,505 --> 00:48:29,339
By Miko.

1433
00:48:33,043 --> 00:48:34,778
- Don't do that.

1434
00:48:34,778 --> 00:48:35,879
- Stand by.

1435
00:48:37,047 --> 00:48:39,082
We are now entering the
atmosphere of Venus.

1436
00:48:39,082 --> 00:48:39,917
Attention.

1437
00:48:43,186 --> 00:48:44,354
- [Servo] Oh, a hostile planet.

1438
00:48:44,354 --> 00:48:46,323
Oh put me on the guest list.

1439
00:48:52,829 --> 00:48:55,065
- [Joel] I'm in the
Willy Wonka mobile, sir.

1440
00:48:55,065 --> 00:48:57,034
- [Servo] I made this from
a soft serve yogurt machine.

1441
00:48:57,034 --> 00:48:58,769
I call the fentoozler.

1442
00:49:01,405 --> 00:49:02,906
- [Joel] Well if
that don't beat all.

1443
00:49:02,906 --> 00:49:03,941
I'll tell you.

1444
00:49:03,941 --> 00:49:04,875
- [Intercom] 300 miles altitude.

1445
00:49:04,875 --> 00:49:06,109
- [Servo] Fly's open.

1446
00:49:06,109 --> 00:49:07,911
- [Intercom] Four point
three miles a second.

1447
00:49:09,680 --> 00:49:11,014
- Are you ready, Brinkmann?

1448
00:49:14,184 --> 00:49:15,118
(laughing)

1449
00:49:15,118 --> 00:49:16,353
- Oh the guys lunch meat.

1450
00:49:16,353 --> 00:49:17,554
Hi, Bill.

1451
00:49:17,554 --> 00:49:19,823
He's got no idea what
I'm saying to him.

1452
00:49:19,823 --> 00:49:20,891
You look good.

1453
00:49:20,891 --> 00:49:21,892
He's dead.

1454
00:49:21,892 --> 00:49:23,126
Good luck.

1455
00:49:23,126 --> 00:49:24,962
He'll never see
his family again.

1456
00:49:24,962 --> 00:49:26,463
Way to go, sport.

1457
00:49:26,463 --> 00:49:28,432
He'll be vaporized
within the hour.

1458
00:49:28,432 --> 00:49:29,399
We're with you.

1459
00:49:29,399 --> 00:49:30,300
Sucker.

1460
00:49:33,403 --> 00:49:35,472
- [Joel] This
baby's really comfy.

1461
00:49:35,472 --> 00:49:36,940
I wonder if the radio works.

1462
00:49:38,342 --> 00:49:39,876
- Brinkmann, hello.

1463
00:49:39,876 --> 00:49:41,545
Hello, Brinkmann.

1464
00:49:41,545 --> 00:49:42,379
- [Brinkmann] Hello?

1465
00:49:43,547 --> 00:49:45,182
- What's the matter
with his receiver?

1466
00:49:45,182 --> 00:49:46,350
- [Brinkmann] I'm
not getting you.

1467
00:49:46,350 --> 00:49:47,784
- [Servo] I'm getting
the ha channel.

1468
00:49:47,784 --> 00:49:48,719
- There's something
wrong with your receiver.

1469
00:49:48,719 --> 00:49:50,087
Can you hear me now?

1470
00:49:50,087 --> 00:49:51,588
- [Brinkmann] I
can't understand you.

1471
00:49:51,588 --> 00:49:52,789
Somethings wrong with
your transmitter.

1472
00:49:52,789 --> 00:49:53,757
- My transmitter?

1473
00:49:53,757 --> 00:49:54,992
Look, dick weed.

1474
00:49:54,992 --> 00:49:56,026
- What's the matter
with our transmitter.

1475
00:49:56,026 --> 00:49:57,427
- Heavy electrical disturbance.

1476
00:49:57,427 --> 00:49:59,129
We're completely blocked out.

1477
00:50:00,464 --> 00:50:01,965
- Hello, Brinkmann.

1478
00:50:02,833 --> 00:50:04,334
What is it, Brinkmann?

1479
00:50:05,736 --> 00:50:08,305
- [Joel] I knew I shouldn't
have switched from AT&T.

1480
00:50:08,305 --> 00:50:11,541
- Hey, I'm flying
through some confetti.

1481
00:50:11,541 --> 00:50:13,844
Apparently, they're throwing
me a surprise party.

1482
00:50:13,844 --> 00:50:15,078
(cheering)

1483
00:50:15,078 --> 00:50:16,079
- Radar indicates
that the surface

1484
00:50:16,079 --> 00:50:18,248
is extremely mountainous.

1485
00:50:18,248 --> 00:50:19,683
I can't see anything.

1486
00:50:19,683 --> 00:50:21,585
I'm completely surrounded
by thick clouds.

1487
00:50:21,585 --> 00:50:23,954
- [Joel] Mostly
produced by my own body.

1488
00:50:23,954 --> 00:50:25,188
- I can see land.

1489
00:50:25,188 --> 00:50:27,090
I can see land.

1490
00:50:27,090 --> 00:50:29,693
- [Servo] Traffic is
heavy over I-94 outbound.

1491
00:50:33,530 --> 00:50:34,564
- Hello, hello.

1492
00:50:34,564 --> 00:50:35,799
- [Servo] Hello.

1493
00:50:35,799 --> 00:50:37,467
- Cosmostraiter,
I can't hear you.

1494
00:50:37,467 --> 00:50:39,036
I'm landing...

1495
00:50:39,036 --> 00:50:40,137
- And I can't get up.

1496
00:50:40,137 --> 00:50:43,006
(ethereal ringing)

1497
00:50:45,409 --> 00:50:47,244
- Brinkmann is not receiving us.

1498
00:50:47,244 --> 00:50:48,512
I can't make contact.

1499
00:50:48,512 --> 00:50:50,013
- [Joel] So that's a bad thing?

1500
00:50:50,013 --> 00:50:52,616
- [Servo] At least we have
our Ewok suits to cheer us up.

1501
00:50:52,616 --> 00:50:53,717
- 2,400 feet.

1502
00:50:56,820 --> 00:50:59,556
- [Servo] The papers want to
know who's shirt you wear.

1503
00:51:03,994 --> 00:51:06,063
- Hey, he's landed on a witch.

1504
00:51:14,771 --> 00:51:17,007
- [Joel] We secretly
switched their planet

1505
00:51:17,007 --> 00:51:18,842
