1506
00:51:21,344 --> 00:51:23,213
- Omigow, you take the lead.

1507
00:51:23,213 --> 00:51:24,748
Go on.

1508
00:51:24,748 --> 00:51:27,984
- [Joel] This planet is a
cookie, a crunchy cookie.

1509
00:51:31,721 --> 00:51:32,556
- Yeah, yeah.

1510
00:51:32,556 --> 00:51:34,291
Queen to queen's pawn 4.

1511
00:51:35,459 --> 00:51:36,293
- [Joel] We know.

1512
00:51:36,293 --> 00:51:37,427
- I'm right behind you.

1513
00:51:44,534 --> 00:51:45,769
- I don't understand.

1514
00:51:45,769 --> 00:51:48,171
I'm puzzled by these
strange flashes

1515
00:51:48,171 --> 00:51:49,506
of light which we keep seeing.

1516
00:51:49,506 --> 00:51:51,141
- [Joel] I'm also
bemused and charmed

1517
00:51:51,141 --> 00:51:52,375
by this plucky planet.

1518
00:51:52,375 --> 00:51:54,311
- Is bursting all around us.

1519
00:51:54,311 --> 00:51:55,979
What do you make
of them, Orloff?

1520
00:51:55,979 --> 00:51:57,414
- [Servo] Flavor buds.

1521
00:51:57,414 --> 00:52:00,150
- In my opinion, the atmosphere
in this area is ionized.

1522
00:52:00,150 --> 00:52:01,151
- Well, what's the cause?

1523
00:52:01,151 --> 00:52:02,385
- Atomic radiation.

1524
00:52:02,385 --> 00:52:05,555
- Then that means that
they're attacking us

1525
00:52:05,555 --> 00:52:06,523
and Brinkmann.

1526
00:52:06,523 --> 00:52:08,058
- We must fly lower.

1527
00:52:09,693 --> 00:52:11,862
We must get below
this bank of clouds

1528
00:52:11,862 --> 00:52:14,131
