01:11:46,135 --> 01:11:47,336
It just goes...

2042
01:11:51,206 --> 01:11:52,741
- [Servo] Cleans up in a jiffy.

2043
01:11:54,209 --> 01:11:56,011
- Looks like someone
stands corrected

2044
01:11:56,011 --> 01:11:57,346
on that don't shoot line.

2045
01:11:59,715 --> 01:12:00,883
- What was that?

2046
01:12:00,883 --> 01:12:02,217
